<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Performs binary search on a sorted list to find the index of a target value.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">4</span>
