<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Calculates the Compound Annual Growth Rate (CAGR) of an investment.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
