</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">6</span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">calculate_grade</span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.7.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.7.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Calculates the weighted average grade based on scores and their corresponding weights.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">7</span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">calculate_median</span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.8.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
