</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">8</span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">can_attend_all_meetings</span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.9.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.9.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Determines if a person can attend all meetings given a list of meeting time intervals.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">9</span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">cosine_similarity</span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.10.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.10.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.10.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Calculates the cosine similarity between two vectors.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.11" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">10</span>
